# Paths relative to cloud-gpu/. Local run dirs and credentials must never enter git.
runs/
**/key.pem
**/privkey*.pem
**/kaggle_token
**/kaggle.json
**/colab_adc.json
**/vault.json
# One-time envelopes in secrets/ ARE committed on purpose (that is the credential
# channel) and consumed (deleted) by the relay in the same run.
